---
---
<section class="section-post-launch" id="post-launch">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="post-launch-grid">
      
      <div class="pl-sidebar">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          După publicare
        </span>
        <h2 class="pl-title">
          Verificăm ceea ce a fost convenit pentru relansare.
        </h2>
        <div class="pl-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-accordion-wrapper">
        <details class="pl-accordion" open>
          <summary class="pl-summary">
            Suport și Asistență Continuă
            <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="pl-panel">
            <p>
              După lansare sunt controlate punctele tehnice convenite. Dacă este stabilit expres, vă putem sprijini ulterior prin mentenanță, remedierea erorilor, optimizarea performanței, conținut sau dezvoltarea SEO.
            </p>
            <p class="pl-note">
              Asistența continuă este convenită separat, în funcție de website și obiective.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-post-launch {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-page);
  }

  .post-launch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 3.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
  }

  .pl-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pl-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pl-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--brand-purple-soft);
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .pl-icon svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .pl-accordion {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .pl-summary {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    user-select: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .pl-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .pl-summary:hover {
    background: #f1f5f9;
  }
  .chevron {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  details[open] .chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .pl-panel {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .pl-note {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .post-launch-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
